[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:76. April Fools' Day]
[00:00.780]Passage 76 | 文章七十六
[00:03.125]April Fool's Day. | 愚人节。
[00:06.570]To end our special news bulletin, | 为结束我们的特别新闻快报，
[00:11.220]said the voice of the television announcer, | 电视播音员的声音说道，
[00:14.435]we are taking you to the macaroni fields | 我们将带您前往通心粉田
[00:17.725]of Calabria. | 卡拉布里亚。
[00:19.375]Macaroni has been grown in this area | 通心粉已在该地区种植
[00:23.220]for over 600 years. | 超过600年。
[00:26.240]Two of the leading growers, | 两名主要的种植者，
[00:28.720]Giuseppe Moldova and Riccardo Brabante, | 朱塞佩·莫尔多瓦和里卡多·布拉班特，
[00:32.210]tell me that they have been expecting a splendid crop this year, | 告诉我他们今年一直期待着丰收，
[00:36.350]and harvesting has begun earlier than usual. | 收割也比往常开始得早。
[00:41.095]Here, you can see two workers who, between them, | 在这里，你可以看到两名工人，他们之间，
[00:45.900]have just finished cutting three cartloads | 刚刚砍下了三车
[00:49.245]of golden brown macaroni stalks. | 金黄色的通心粉茎。
[00:52.855]The whole village has been working day and night, | 整个村庄昼夜不停地工作，
[00:57.075]gathering and threshing this year's crop | 收集和脱粒今年的庄稼，
[00:59.610]before the September rains. | 在九月雨季来临之前。
[01:02.395]On the right, you can see Mrs. Brabante herself. | 在右边，你可以看到布拉班特夫人本人。
[01:06.930]She has been helping her husband for 30 years now. | 她现在已经帮助她的丈夫30年了。
[01:11.700]Mrs. Brabante is talking to the manager of the local factory | 布拉班特夫人正在与当地工厂的经理交谈，
[01:17.110]where the crop is processed. | 农作物在那里进行加工。
[01:20.030]This last scene shows you what will happen at the end of the harvest, | 这最后一个场景向您展示了收割结束时会发生什么，
[01:25.990]the famous Calabrian macaroni eating competition. | 著名的卡拉布里亚通心粉大赛。
[01:31.325]Senior Fratelli, the present champion, | 现任冠军弗拉泰利先生，
[01:34.835]has won it every year since 1961. | 自1961年以来每年都赢得了这项比赛。
[01:39.370]And that ends our special bulletin for today, | 今天的特别新闻快报到此结束，
[01:44.205]Thursday, April the 5th. | 4月5日，星期四。
[01:47.100]We are now returning you to the studio. | 我们现在将您转回演播室。